       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UNSTRING-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 STUDENT-RECORD PIC X(40)
           VALUE "1001,ARJUN KUMAR,CHENNAI,45000".
       01 STUDENT-ID PIC X(6).
       01 STUDENT-NAME PIC X(15).
       01 STUDENT-CITY PIC X(10).
       01 STUDENT-SALARY PIC X(6).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           UNSTRING STUDENT-RECORD DELIMITED BY ","
               INTO STUDENT-ID STUDENT-NAME
                    STUDENT-CITY STUDENT-SALARY
           END-UNSTRING.
           DISPLAY "ID: " STUDENT-ID.
           DISPLAY "NAME: " STUDENT-NAME.
           DISPLAY "CITY: " STUDENT-CITY.
           DISPLAY "SALARY: " STUDENT-SALARY.
           STOP RUN.
